{"id":"de_termine_","lemma":"déterminé","pos":"adj","rank":4017,"glosses":["determined, resolute, (possessing much determination)","precise; exact"],"ipa":"/de.tɛʁ.mi.ne/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/Fr-d%C3%A9termin%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9termin%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"déterminée","masculinePlural":"déterminés","femininePlural":"déterminées"},"formAudio":{"déterminés":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-d%C3%A9termin%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tu es déterminé.","en":"You're driven.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"C'est une femme déterminée.","en":"She's a determined woman.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"woman"},null]},{"text":"Avons-nous déterminé qui était cet homme ?","en":"Did we find out who that man was?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"man"}]},{"text":"Elle est déterminée à quitter l'entreprise.","en":"She is determined to leave the company.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to leave, to quit"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"company, business"}]},{"text":"Je suis déterminé à devenir un scientifique.","en":"I am determined to be a scientist.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"scientific"}]}]}